        <div class="main-content">
<div class="main-par parsys"><div class="text parbase section">


<div class="default"><h2>Independent information for the dry bulk market</h2>
<p>Our daily spot market and forward assessments, market and fixture reports, weekly S&amp;P and recycling and quarterly OPEX data provide the dry bulk market with a comprehensive, independent reference point.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="image parbase section">



<div id="cq-image-jsp-/content/balticexchange/consumer/en/data-services/market-information0/dry-services/jcr:content/main-par/image_1481037379" class="Default">

<img src="/content/balticexchange/consumer/en/data-services/market-information0/dry-services/_jcr_content/main-par/image_1481037379.img.jpg/1684250729063.jpg" alt="Baltic Dry Routes" title=" " class="cq-dd-image">

</div></div>
<div class="text parbase section">


<div class="default"><p><a href="https://www.balticexchange.com/en/data-services/routes.html">Click here</a>&nbsp;to explore an interactive map of all our routes.</p>
<ul>
<li>$ per day timecharter &amp; $ per tonne voyage assessments<br>
</li>
<li>Capesize, Panamax, Supramax and Handysize</li>
<li>Historical data since 1985</li>
<li>Published throughout the global working day</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="image parbase section">



<div id="cq-image-jsp-/content/balticexchange/consumer/en/data-services/market-information0/dry-services/jcr:content/main-par/image" class="Default">

