            <div class="parsys"><div class="text parbase section">


<div class="default"><p>The Baltic Dry Index (BDI) is a composite of the dry bulk timecharter averages and provides a continuous time series since 1985.</p>
<ul>
<li>Baltic Capesize Index (40%)</li>
<li>Baltic Panamax Index (30%)&nbsp;</li>
<li>Baltic Supramax Index (30%)&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
