    data-mode="separate">


    <div class="parsys accordionparsys"><div class="accordionitem parbase section">


<div id="main_par_accordion2_517468538item" class="accordion-content" >
    <div class="accordion-header-wrapper" id="null">
        <h3 class="accordion-header">Capesize Index</h3>
        <span class="accordion-header-icon"> </span>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-content-wrapper">
        <div class="accordion-content-inner">
            <div class="parsys"><div class="text parbase section">


<div class="default"><p>C2 - Tubarao to Rotterdam<br>
C3 - Tubarao to Qingdao<br>
C5 - West Australia to Qingdao<br>
C7 - Bolivar to Rotterdam<br>
C8_182 - Gibraltar/Hamburg transatlantic round voyage<br>
C9_182 -&nbsp;Cont-Med trip China-Japan<br>
C10_182 -&nbsp;China-Japan transpacific round voyage<br>
C14_182 -&nbsp;China - Brazil or West Africa round voyage<br>
C16_182 -&nbsp;Far East-Atlantic Backhaul<br>
C17 - Saldanha Bay to Qingdao<br>
<br>
5TC_182 Weighted Timecharter Average: Sum(C8_182*0.15, C9_182*0.125, C10_182*0.35, C14_182*0.25, C16_182*0.125)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p>Baltic Capesize vessel for Timecharter routes is a non scrubber fitted vessel based on the following description:<br>
<br>
182,000mt dwt on 18.2m SSW draft<br>
Max age 10 yrs<br>
LOA 292m, beam 45m, TPC 123,<br>
199,500cbm grain<br>
Speed &amp; Consumption:<br>
14 knots on 52 MT Laden, 44 Ballast. MFO<br>
13 knots on 44 MT Laden, 36 Ballast. MFO<br>
12 knots on 36 MT Laden, 29 Ballast. MFO<br>
11 knots on 29 MT Laden, 23 Ballast. MFO, no diesel at sea.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>

</div>

