<div class="default"><p>P1A_82 - Skaw-Gib transatlantic round voyage<br>
P2A_82 - Skaw-Gib trip to Taiwan-Japan<br>
P3A_82 -&nbsp;Hong Kong-South Korea transpacific round voyage &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>
P4_82 -&nbsp;Hong Kong-South Korea trip to Skaw-Passero &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>
