</p>
<p>Baltic Handysize Index (BHSI): Sum(HS1_38*0.006944444, HS2_38*0.006944444, HS3_38*0.006944444, HS4_38*0.006944444, HS5_38*0.011111111, HS6_38*0.011111111, HS7_38*0.005555556)&nbsp;Baltic Handysize 38 vessel for Timecharter routes is a non-scrubber fitted vessel based on the following description:<br>
</p>
