<div class="default"><p>Weekly assessments of in US $/Lightweight for dry bulk carriers.</p>
<p>Delivery in Bangladesh, India &amp; Pakistan.</p>
<ul>
<li>Large bulk carrier 20,000+ LDT</li>
<li>Medium bulk carrier 9,001 - 20,000 LDT</li>
<li>Small bulk carrier 5,000 - 9000 LDT&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
