<div class="default"><h2><b>Fixtures and market reports</b></h2>
<p><span style="background-color: transparent;">The Baltic Exchange's team of freight market reporters in London and Singapore produces a daily fixture list and daily news round-up for the dry bulk market.<br>
 <br>
 Our comprehensive fixture list can be readily integrated with users’ systems and provides historical data and contains around 100,000 fixtures.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
